e and  there gathering some news that would  channelize the news in a manner that  they would be trying to in fact be  trying to engage Iran with this we  totally reject this it is very  suspicious to us and we hope that the  international fact-finding mission could  really find the the reasons for these  sabotages which was very suspicious to  us G thing around is being framed and  blamed for this unfairly Iran has been  always unfairly blamed for many things  in the region we have been a country  which has been paying many costs for  keeping the peace and stability in the  region being in our relations with our  neighbors which have very good relations  with in the Persian Gulf so we would be  committing to our international  obligations and also also a  responsibility to keep peace and  stability in the region the Americans  say their policy is working and that  they are putting your government under  enormous pressure it's just a matter of  time before the government either Falls  or is forced back to the negotiating  table is that a fair characterization of  where your government is now do you  think maybe not the whole the whole  system in the US but unfortunately  unfortunately partially that has been  the in fact the the simp the  simplification of the kind of illusion  that they have that in fact they can  pressurize Iran and the government of  Iran and they can really look for regime  change in Iran but I tell you that  Iranian  nation is very solid at this moment even  some of the some of the elements and  some of the political parties in Iran  which were and it had been skeptical  about the approach which has adopted by  the government or now fully supporting  the government that we should merely be  resisting any provocations by the US  because Iran has been very faithful in  implementing its shares of obligations  and now this is a time that the other  parties should also behave very  responsibly in the region and the main  parties to the jcpoa nuclear